dataTypes.text:
# انواع داده‌ها

## استان (State)

```ts
type State = {
  id: number;
  name: string;
  center: string;
  latitude: string;
  longitude: string;
  landlinePrefix: string;
  carLicencePlates: string[];
  cities?: City[];
};
```

## شهر (City)

```ts
type City = {
  id?: number;
  name: string;
  latitude: string;
  longitude: string;
};
```

## پارامترهای استان

```ts
type StateQueryParams = {
  id?: string;
  state?: string;
  landlinePrefix?: string;
  carLicencePlate?: string;
};
```

## پارامترهای شهر

```ts
type CitiesQueryParams = {
  state?: string;
  state_id?: string;
  city?: string;
};
```
